		    <li><a href="">&nbsp;</a></li>
		    <li><a href="/cview/help/map_submission">向 SGN 提交圖譜資訊(Submit map information to SGN)</a></li>
		  </div>
		</ul>
	</li>

	<li class="Genes"><a href="/search/direct_search.pl?search=loci" style="background: none"><img src="/img/soliconmenu/Genes.png" title="基因(Genes)" /></a>
