            <div class="submenu GenesSubMenu"  >
              <li><a href="/search/direct_search.pl?search=loci">搜尋基因座(Search loci)</a></li>
              <li><a href="/search/direct_search.pl?search=unigene">搜尋 Unigene(Search unigenes)</a></li>
              <li><a href="/search/direct_search.pl?search=template">基因表現(Expression)</a></li>
              <li><a href="/organism/Solanum_lycopersicum/genome">搜尋/瀏覽番茄基因組(Search/browse tomato genome)</a></li>
	      <li><a href="/phenome/">成為 SGN 基因座編輯者(Become an SGN locus editor)</a></li>
	      </div>

	  </ul>



	<li class="Phenotypes"><a href="/search/direct_search.pl?search=phenotypes" style="background: none"><img src="/img/soliconmenu/Phenotypes.png" alt="表型與 QTL(Phenotypes and QTLs)" title="表型與 QTL(Phenotypes and QTLs)" /></a>
	  <ul>
	    <div class="submenu PhenotypesSubMenu">
              <li><a href="/search/direct_search.pl?search=phenotypes">搜尋表型(Search phenotypes)</a></li>

              <li><a href="/qtl/">分析 QTL(Analyze QTLs)</a></li>
              <li><a href="/tools/onto/">本體瀏覽器(Ontology browser)</a></li>
	      <li><a href="">&nbsp;</a></li>
	      <li><a href="/phenome/">提交表型數據(Submit phenotype data)</a></li>
            </div>
          </ul>

	</li>

    <li class="BreedersToolBox"><a href="/breeders/"><img src="/img/soliconmenu/BreedersToolBox.png" alt="育種者工具箱(Breeders Toolbox)" title="點擊存取育種者工具箱(Click to access the Breeder's toolbox)" /></a>
