	</li>

  <li class="GenomesSequences"><a href="/genomes"><img src="/img/soliconmenu/GenomesSequences.png" alt="基因組與序列(Genomes and Sequences)" title="基因組與序列(Genomes and Sequences)" /></a>
    <ul>
      <div class="submenu GenomesSequencesSubMenu">
        <li><a href="/organism/Solanum_lycopersicum/genome">番茄基因組計畫(Tomato Genome Project)</a></li>
